.th CHECKLIST V 5/31/77
.sh NAME
checklist \*- list of file systems processed by check
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it Checklist
resides in directory
.bd /etc
and contains a
list of at most 15
.it "special file"
names.
Each
.it "special file"
name is contained on a separate line and
corresponds to a file system.
Each file system will then be automatically processed
by the
.it check(VIII)
command.
.sh "SEE ALSO"
check(VIII)
